#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD9704 expect=noViolation domain=MI
# Rule:Description: FDA-SD9704 — the Required key MISPEC is not populated.
#note "MISPEC populated -> noViolation; the twin scenario differs only in the value of MISPEC."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset MI
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col MISEQ type=Char
col MITESTCD type=Char
col MITEST type=Char
col MISPEC type=Char
---
S1      | MI     | S1-001  | 1     | MIEXAM   | Microscopic Examination | LIVER
---
